<title>USA: Information Management Tech CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Information Management Tech CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information Management Technologies Corp said on Thursday that Christopher Holbrook resigned as chief executive officer, chief operating officer and a director but will continue to serve as a consultant to the company.</p>
<p>The company said it has appointed Robert Oxenberg, the chairman of the company, to act as interim chief executive officer.</p>
